[{"start":3351.248,"end":3355.068,"text":"And from a lot of stuff about images that we've seen so far,"},{"start":3355.148,"end":3358.888,"text":"we're moving to sound. So, let's welcome to the stage,"},{"start":3359.748,"end":3360.328,"text":"Cong Lin"},{"start":3361.268,"end":3365.128,"text":"from the Chinese Academy of Sciences, who is going to tell us about"},{"start":3365.188,"end":3366.948,"text":"Soundscapes China."},{"start":3372.068,"end":3372.388,"text":"Thank you. Okay."},{"start":3373.568,"end":3374.588,"text":"Hello, everyone."},{"start":3375.748,"end":3378.368,"text":"I come from China, the Institute of Geology."},{"start":3378.448,"end":3381.968,"text":"And I want to share the topics about Soundscape"},{"start":3382.048,"end":3383.188,"text":"China. We"},{"start":3384.808,"end":3386.488,"text":"initiate this project"},{"start":3388.128,"end":3390.668,"text":"to collect nature sounds by AI."},{"start":3392.908,"end":3396.588,"text":"And my topics includes four parts."},{"start":3398.828,"end":3399.328,"text":"Firstly,"},{"start":3400.268,"end":3400.748,"text":"I think"},{"start":3402.388,"end":3406.248,"text":"when you see these images, the sounds of the birds, the"},{"start":3406.308,"end":3409.828,"text":"mammals, the frogs, and the sounds of the wind,"},{"start":3410.408,"end":3411.788,"text":"the rain, the thunders,"},{"start":3412.588,"end":3416.308,"text":"are emerging in your brain. And soundscape ecology"},{"start":3417.808,"end":3421.568,"text":"takes the sounds within a landscape and its"},{"start":3421.668,"end":3422.188,"text":"research"},{"start":3423.048,"end":3426.948,"text":"subject, exploring the distribution and variation"},{"start":3427.168,"end":3430.828,"text":"patterns across different spatial and temporal"},{"start":3431.568,"end":3432.248,"text":"dimensions."},{"start":3433.428,"end":3433.628,"text":"So"},{"start":3434.708,"end":3438.448,"text":"we research on the sounds of"},{"start":3438.528,"end":3439.948,"text":"animals and also their"},{"start":3440.888,"end":3441.948,"text":"living environment."},{"start":3444.568,"end":3448.488,"text":"This image shows the soundscape and the relationship"},{"start":3448.528,"end":3452.268,"text":"between biodiversity. And the genetic diversity"},{"start":3454.248,"end":3455.308,"text":"is related to"},{"start":3456.148,"end":3459.008,"text":"how or what sounds or species"},{"start":3460.808,"end":3464.268,"text":"happened. And the species diversity, ecosystem"},{"start":3464.328,"end":3467.328,"text":"diversity, and landscape diversity"},{"start":3468.408,"end":3472.088,"text":"may result in the components of the soundscape,"},{"start":3472.548,"end":3474.688,"text":"the sounds diversity. And"},{"start":3475.808,"end":3479.588,"text":"maybe culture diversity is also very close to"},{"start":3480.228,"end":3483.888,"text":"the soundscape because many music art"},{"start":3485.068,"end":3486.508,"text":"are generated"},{"start":3488.728,"end":3490.668,"text":"from the nature sounds."},{"start":3492.948,"end":3493.148,"text":"So,"},{"start":3494.268,"end":3494.888,"text":"nature sounds"},{"start":3495.888,"end":3497.968,"text":"diversity is an important indicator"},{"start":3498.968,"end":3502.808,"text":"of biodiversity. And"},{"start":3503.248,"end":3506.708,"text":"the passive acoustic monitoring"},{"start":3507.728,"end":3511.488,"text":"has become an important means of biodiversity"},{"start":3511.548,"end":3512.128,"text":"monitoring."},{"start":3513.008,"end":3513.688,"text":"And China"},{"start":3516.268,"end":3519.148,"text":"wants to build a broad monitoring network"},{"start":3519.708,"end":3523.068,"text":"nationwide. So there's some urgent"},{"start":3523.828,"end":3527.188,"text":"things we need to do. The first is to"},{"start":3527.248,"end":3530.128,"text":"develop and select standard sound sensors."},{"start":3534.248,"end":3535.228,"text":"The sensor is"},{"start":3536.888,"end":3539.128,"text":"4 or 5G, and with long"},{"start":3540.188,"end":3543.868,"text":"battery life and suitability for various"},{"start":3544.268,"end":3547.288,"text":"field work for building the monitoring network."},{"start":3550.128,"end":3553.428,"text":"Second, we need a nature sound database"},{"start":3553.628,"end":3557.388,"text":"covering multiple categories, multiple"},{"start":3558.048,"end":3561.488,"text":"regions, and long time series for training AI"},{"start":3561.748,"end":3563.548,"text":"models for monitoring system."},{"start":3565.968,"end":3569.868,"text":"And we encourage the public to contribute their data"},{"start":3570.788,"end":3572.188,"text":"and encourage sound art"},{"start":3573.528,"end":3577.468,"text":"creation, thereby enhancing our outreach"},{"start":3578.368,"end":3578.988,"text":"capacity."},{"start":3581.328,"end":3585.028,"text":"Why Soundscape China? So we try to provide a"},{"start":3585.088,"end":3588.948,"text":"platform for testing sound sensors or sound"},{"start":3589.008,"end":3592.768,"text":"devices from different companies"},{"start":3592.908,"end":3593.648,"text":"in real-world"},{"start":3594.688,"end":3595.288,"text":"scenarios,"},{"start":3596.248,"end":3599.888,"text":"and then collecting nature sounds in various habitats"},{"start":3600.408,"end":3601.748,"text":"to build a database,"},{"start":3602.848,"end":3606.268,"text":"and training models for sound event detection and species"},{"start":3606.328,"end":3610.008,"text":"recognition. Also involving the public"},{"start":3610.588,"end":3613.308,"text":"and artists in contributing their"},{"start":3613.668,"end":3617.488,"text":"creativity on nature sounds."},{"start":3617.928,"end":3621.648,"text":"So this is our framework of Soundscape China."},{"start":3623.428,"end":3625.448,"text":"And how we organize this project."},{"start":3627.988,"end":3629.328,"text":"Okay, this is the framework."},{"start":3632.268,"end":3635.868,"text":"Firstly, we want to create or build a platform"},{"start":3636.588,"end":3640.168,"text":"that includes various sensors, sound models,"},{"start":3640.528,"end":3642.508,"text":"and sound database. And"},{"start":3643.428,"end":3647.068,"text":"we have many parties involved into this project, like"},{"start":3647.128,"end":3651.048,"text":"institutes, universities, governments, and public."},{"start":3651.768,"end":3652.888,"text":"And we will provide"},{"start":3654.728,"end":3658.348,"text":"multiple services like data sharing,"},{"start":3659.008,"end":3662.988,"text":"audio annotation, audio analysis, and model"},{"start":3663.048,"end":3663.428,"text":"training."},{"start":3664.518,"end":3668.478,"text":"And also we face to biodiversity monitoring,"},{"start":3668.918,"end":3672.758,"text":"sound art, and citizen science. So this is the whole framework"},{"start":3672.878,"end":3674.498,"text":"of our project. And"},{"start":3675.378,"end":3677.498,"text":"this is the management team. And"},{"start":3679.058,"end":3682.358,"text":"I am responsible for the monitoring group."},{"start":3683.198,"end":3683.518,"text":"And"},{"start":3684.558,"end":3688.378,"text":"Colin, the other Colin, is responsible for the sound"},{"start":3688.518,"end":3690.098,"text":"art group. And"},{"start":3691.318,"end":3694.638,"text":"Gao is"},{"start":3694.738,"end":3696.737,"text":"responsible for the citizen science group."},{"start":3696.798,"end":3696.918,"text":"And"},{"start":3698.518,"end":3701.478,"text":"He and Zhang responsible of field training"},{"start":3701.558,"end":3703.418,"text":"work."},{"start":3705.698,"end":3708.578,"text":"And this is the list of our partner"},{"start":3708.818,"end":3712.798,"text":"organizations, include some institutions, some"},{"start":3713.818,"end":3717.078,"text":"government departments, and some universities."},{"start":3719.478,"end":3723.258,"text":"Yeah. And I want to share some progress on this project."},{"start":3724.278,"end":3727.658,"text":"And firstly, we called for the equipments."},{"start":3727.798,"end":3728.538,"text":"So we have"},{"start":3730.278,"end":3730.718,"text":"about"},{"start":3732.178,"end":3736.038,"text":"280 devices now, and they have been"},{"start":3736.118,"end":3737.918,"text":"deployed in different"},{"start":3739.058,"end":3740.658,"text":"places across China."},{"start":3741.478,"end":3741.618,"text":"And"},{"start":3743.138,"end":3745.818,"text":"below, this is the devices we had"},{"start":3747.138,"end":3749.818,"text":"get from the different companies."},{"start":3750.418,"end":3751.878,"text":"And we have standards."},{"start":3752.738,"end":3756.518,"text":"Firstly, the devices should be 4 or"},{"start":3756.798,"end":3760.718,"text":"5G that can automatically transfer the"},{"start":3760.798,"end":3761.878,"text":"data back,"},{"start":3762.758,"end":3764.318,"text":"and it should be solar-powered,"},{"start":3765.238,"end":3765.518,"text":"and"},{"start":3767.198,"end":3769.798,"text":"should meet more than 50"},{"start":3770.638,"end":3774.198,"text":"days storage. And also we have plugin for"},{"start":3774.258,"end":3777.758,"text":"microphone that can be used by the citizen science."},{"start":3779.838,"end":3780.858,"text":"This is the users."},{"start":3781.798,"end":3783.178,"text":"More than about"},{"start":3790.718,"end":3792.438,"text":"110 organizations are"},{"start":3793.018,"end":3796.738,"text":"participating in this"},{"start":3797.238,"end":3799.098,"text":"project, and they get the"},{"start":3800.038,"end":3801.338,"text":"devices. They"},{"start":3802.218,"end":3802.638,"text":"deploy"},{"start":3803.458,"end":3804.778,"text":"these devices. Okay."},{"start":3806.178,"end":3809.598,"text":"Okay, these images, those people get the"},{"start":3809.658,"end":3813.098,"text":"devices and then go outside into the fields to"},{"start":3813.938,"end":3814.918,"text":"install to"},{"start":3815.838,"end":3819.278,"text":"the devices outside. And then the data will"},{"start":3819.338,"end":3823.018,"text":"transfer automatically to our platform."},{"start":3824.278,"end":3825.978,"text":"And this is the"},{"start":3828.338,"end":3831.558,"text":"network and the sites we have deployed"},{"start":3832.398,"end":3832.678,"text":"the"},{"start":3834.618,"end":3837.858,"text":"devices and more than 260"},{"start":3839.058,"end":3840.758,"text":"sites have been"},{"start":3842.598,"end":3843.298,"text":"deployed."},{"start":3844.558,"end":3847.758,"text":"And this is our platform, Soundscape China."},{"start":3848.518,"end":3852.378,"text":"And we also have a citizen science app that people"},{"start":3852.458,"end":3853.518,"text":"can record"},{"start":3854.438,"end":3855.838,"text":"the sounds around them and"},{"start":3856.678,"end":3858.598,"text":"upload the sounds to our platform."},{"start":3861.158,"end":3865.078,"text":"And we also use the DownCall archive for our data"},{"start":3865.178,"end":3869.158,"text":"standard, but some"},{"start":3869.198,"end":3873.058,"text":"data cannot be included in the DownCall standard,"},{"start":3873.118,"end":3876.118,"text":"like equipment. I cannot find the equipment component."},{"start":3876.258,"end":3879.918,"text":"And also we extend and localize the DownCall"},{"start":3880.458,"end":3884.158,"text":"to make it better suited to Chinese application."},{"start":3885.898,"end":3889.058,"text":"And we have an annotation tool. So,"},{"start":3890.138,"end":3893.918,"text":"we also have volunteers working on this platform so they can"},{"start":3895.898,"end":3899.178,"text":"label our audio data."},{"start":3900.238,"end":3904.018,"text":"And this is a model framework, and this is proposed"},{"start":3904.098,"end":3906.338,"text":"by our team. And"},{"start":3907.718,"end":3909.098,"text":"we try to"},{"start":3910.178,"end":3913.898,"text":"pre-train the"},{"start":3914.058,"end":3917.638,"text":"data from the two dimension, the time"},{"start":3917.698,"end":3920.598,"text":"dimension and the frequency dimension."},{"start":3920.658,"end":3923.637,"text":"And the spectrum is patched"},{"start":3924.318,"end":3927.258,"text":"into small square and then pre-trained."},{"start":3928.058,"end":3931.778,"text":"And this pre-trained model can be used in the downstream"},{"start":3931.878,"end":3935.358,"text":"task, like sound event detection and classification."},{"start":3935.938,"end":3936.178,"text":"Okay."},{"start":3937.338,"end":3940.118,"text":"And this is the data. We have collected more than"},{"start":3945.018,"end":3946.198,"text":"3.6 million"},{"start":3948.158,"end":3950.878,"text":"records now, one year. Just only one year."},{"start":3952.438,"end":3956.418,"text":"Okay. And this is some examples we have collected"},{"start":3956.478,"end":3957.138,"text":"from different"},{"start":3958.978,"end":3961.738,"text":"permits. I don't want to show this."},{"start":3962.058,"end":3962.358,"text":"And"},{"start":3965.798,"end":3966.438,"text":"okay."},{"start":3970.138,"end":3973.278,"text":"Okay. This is a video, but I think I have no time to show you."},{"start":3973.778,"end":3974.778,"text":"But this is"},{"start":3975.738,"end":3979.098,"text":"some people go outside to make a few"},{"start":3979.238,"end":3982.178,"text":"recordings. They are working hard to do"},{"start":3983.738,"end":3984.878,"text":"their job. And I"},{"start":3986.018,"end":3989.898,"text":"want to share the study case in Shandong Province, and we have"},{"start":3990.518,"end":3990.918,"text":"three"},{"start":3992.738,"end":3994.858,"text":"monitoring sites, and we have collect"},{"start":3995.678,"end":3996.738,"text":"many datas"},{"start":3997.738,"end":3997.978,"text":"for"},{"start":3998.838,"end":4000.138,"text":"analysis. And we can"},{"start":4001.298,"end":4004.898,"text":"see the sound events, the"},{"start":4004.998,"end":4008.258,"text":"bird call events"},{"start":4009.118,"end":4009.558,"text":"across"},{"start":4011.198,"end":4012.638,"text":"every day and"},{"start":4013.778,"end":4016.018,"text":"24 hours. And we can see the"},{"start":4016.858,"end":4020.498,"text":"peak of the sound event in different sites,"},{"start":4020.598,"end":4023.438,"text":"different birds. Okay. And also,"},{"start":4024.338,"end":4024.998,"text":"the trends"},{"start":4029.074,"end":4032.054,"text":"With different environment factors,"},{"start":4033.054,"end":4036.094,"text":"how the environmental factor affect the sound events."},{"start":4037.874,"end":4041.734,"text":"And this program is endorsed by ISSP."},{"start":4042.714,"end":4045.354,"text":"ISSP is in UNESCO"},{"start":4046.534,"end":4047.374,"text":"Science Decades."},{"start":4049.294,"end":4053.054,"text":"And next step, we will call for more"},{"start":4053.154,"end":4056.314,"text":"devices from different companies for testing,"},{"start":4056.934,"end":4060.354,"text":"and then we will build our more broad"},{"start":4061.794,"end":4065.454,"text":"network for Soundscape China. And then we will"},{"start":4066.614,"end":4069.914,"text":"publish audio datasets to public for"},{"start":4069.994,"end":4073.754,"text":"non-commercial use. And yes, we have"},{"start":4075.114,"end":4077.334,"text":"annotated many audio"},{"start":4078.454,"end":4081.474,"text":"data now that we can release this for research."},{"start":4082.834,"end":4086.494,"text":"And then we continuously refine the acoustic"},{"start":4087.174,"end":4090.233,"text":"recognizing model through iterative training,"},{"start":4091.034,"end":4094.774,"text":"and then accelerate the field recording training and"},{"start":4094.834,"end":4097.834,"text":"promote data science and sound art creation."},{"start":4098.695,"end":4102.674,"text":"Yes, we have many artists about sound involved in"},{"start":4102.735,"end":4103.695,"text":"this project."},{"start":4104.954,"end":4105.195,"text":"Okay."},{"start":4106.434,"end":4106.974,"text":"This is the"},{"start":4108.294,"end":4112.214,"text":"last slide. And I want to thank all"},{"start":4112.254,"end":4115.614,"text":"the people, all the organizations involved into this project."},{"start":4116.414,"end":4119.394,"text":"And thank you. My name is Colin. You can call me Colin."},{"start":4119.735,"end":4123.634,"text":"My Chinese is hard to pronounce. Okay. Thank you, everyone."},{"start":4128.474,"end":4131.914,"text":"Thank you, Colin, for that. So we have time for one or two questions. Go ahead."},{"start":4134.454,"end":4135.454,"text":"Yeah. Thank you very much."},{"start":4136.254,"end":4140.094,"text":"An obvious question to me is, what about extending the frequency range?"},{"start":4140.195,"end":4144.134,"text":"Because there are a lot of species that are significant components of the"},{"start":4144.195,"end":4148.134,"text":"ecosystem that are above 20 kilohertz, for example,"},{"start":4148.195,"end":4152.174,"text":"like bats are the obvious one. But that could easily be true of"},{"start":4152.235,"end":4153.974,"text":"things below 20 hertz as well,"},{"start":4155.014,"end":4158.815,"text":"say in the African system. Have you thought about expanding, or"},{"start":4158.894,"end":4161.934,"text":"are there products out there that handle a higher frequency"},{"start":4162.034,"end":4162.914,"text":"range?"},{"start":4164.994,"end":4167.054,"text":"I cannot catch. I'll review."},{"start":4169.695,"end":4172.974,"text":"Yeah. I was asking if there was any"},{"start":4173.534,"end":4177.434,"text":"idea that you may have to extend the frequency range"},{"start":4178.775,"end":4182.434,"text":"to species that are operating, say,"},{"start":4182.655,"end":4186.414,"text":"above 20 kilohertz, like bats, and they are"},{"start":4186.474,"end":4187.094,"text":"significant"},{"start":4188.034,"end":4189.934,"text":"players in the ecosystem."},{"start":4191.735,"end":4191.834,"text":"For-"},{"start":4193.855,"end":4194.014,"text":"No?"},{"start":4194.474,"end":4194.674,"text":"No."},{"start":4196.534,"end":4196.734,"text":"Sorry."},{"start":4196.894,"end":4197.834,"text":"I'll speak to you afterwards."},{"start":4197.954,"end":4198.194,"text":"Okay."},{"start":4200.194,"end":4202.014,"text":"Do we have any other questions?"},{"start":4213.054,"end":4213.054,"text":"Yeah."},{"start":4213.094,"end":4214.014,"text":"Over the"},{"start":4214.854,"end":4218.834,"text":"technical things that pop out in my mind, something"},{"start":4219.034,"end":4222.834,"text":"I really want to ask is, the first time I approached"},{"start":4223.454,"end":4227.334,"text":"the idea of the sounds of a biotope"},{"start":4227.394,"end":4229.154,"text":"or ecology piece,"},{"start":4230.654,"end":4234.374,"text":"it was through the idea of the extinction of the experience"},{"start":4234.554,"end":4238.474,"text":"and the amnesia of the ecological things we're living"},{"start":4238.554,"end":4239.734,"text":"of. And"},{"start":4241.014,"end":4244.714,"text":"one thing that stayed in my mind in that moment was, what"},{"start":4244.814,"end":4247.654,"text":"can we lose by letting"},{"start":4248.334,"end":4251.874,"text":"this part of what makes a group of"},{"start":4251.914,"end":4254.094,"text":"biodiversity getting loose, the"},{"start":4255.594,"end":4259.454,"text":"different ways and dynamics, the sounds works to give an"},{"start":4259.814,"end":4263.714,"text":"environment its identity. And now with AI era,"},{"start":4264.094,"end":4267.634,"text":"we have the opportunity of use this data in"},{"start":4268.074,"end":4270.074,"text":"ways I really want to hear."},{"start":4271.614,"end":4272.514,"text":"You mean use AI"},{"start":4274.294,"end":4274.754,"text":"to..."},{"start":4276.914,"end":4280.854,"text":"Oh, yes. So my question was more on"},{"start":4281.114,"end":4283.593,"text":"what have we lose by letting"},{"start":4285.074,"end":4286.234,"text":"some sounds"},{"start":4287.093,"end":4290.774,"text":"and their identity as a group in a ecological"},{"start":4291.714,"end":4292.774,"text":"unit disappear?"},{"start":4298.954,"end":4301.214,"text":"Sorry, I cannot catch what you-- But-"},{"start":4301.734,"end":4301.734,"text":"Yes"},{"start":4301.734,"end":4302.994,"text":"... we can talk each other."},{"start":4303.234,"end":4304.194,"text":"Yeah. Of course."},{"start":4304.274,"end":4304.514,"text":"Okay."},{"start":4305.994,"end":4306.254,"text":"Thank you."}]